{'symbol': 'FANG', 'date': '2022-10-17 17:12:00', 'title': 'DIAMONDBACK ENERGY PRICES OFFERING OF SENIOR NOTES', 'text': 'MIDLAND, TEXAS, OCT. 17, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DIAMONDBACK ENERGY, INC. (NASDAQ: FANG) (“DIAMONDBACK”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PRICED AN OFFERING (THE “NOTES OFFERING”) OF $1,100,000,000 IN AGGREGATE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT OF 6.250% SENIOR NOTES THAT WILL MATURE ON MARCH 15, 2033 (THE “NOTES”). THE PRICE TO THE PUBLIC FOR THE NOTES IS 99.572% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT.'}